# LONMA Membership System - Complete API

Live URL: https://lonma-orbit-24qw.onrender.com

## Admin Login
- Email: admin@lonma.com
- Password: admin123

## API Key
Master Key: lonma_api_key_12345
Header: X-API-KEY: lonma_api_key_12345

## API Endpoints

### Health (No Auth)
GET /api/health

### Docs
GET /api

### Get All Members
GET /api/members
Headers: X-API-KEY: lonma_api_key_12345

### Register
POST /api/register
Body JSON:
{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "0712345678",
  "membership": "Premium"
}

### Login
POST /api/login
Body: {"email":"admin@lonma.com","password":"admin123"}

### Update
PUT /api/members/1
Headers: X-API-KEY + Content-Type: application/json
Body: {"role":"Admin","phone":"0700000000"}

### Delete
DELETE /api/members/1
Headers: X-API-KEY

### Stats
GET /api/stats
Headers: X-API-KEY

## Frontend Example
```html
<script>
async function getMembers() {
  const res = await fetch("https://lonma-orbit-24qw.onrender.com/api/members", {
    headers: { "X-API-KEY": "lonma_api_key_12345" }
  });
  const data = await res.json();
  console.log(data.members);
}
getMembers();
</script>
